 *
 * Upstream: midnightntwrk/midnight-docs#902
 * (ownPublicKey() warning is missing on auto-synced reference pages).
 * This lab file is the warning those pages do not carry. It does not
 * edit midnight-docs and does not claim a public contract deploy.
 *
 * Extra invariant the official claimOwnership snippet does not assert:
 * the owner slot must be empty before the first disclose() write, so a
 * second claim cannot overwrite the commitment. Docs say store it once.
 *
 * Language pin: Compact ~0.31.1 / language ~0.23 (lab). Official sample
 * uses `pragma language_version 0.23.0`.
